==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|honourable}}, from {{der|en|fro|honorable}}, {{m|fro|honurable}}, from {{der|en|la|honōrābilis}}, from {{m|la|honōrō||I honour}}; cognate with {{cog|it|onorabile}}, {{cog|es|honorable}}. {{surf|en|honour|-able}}. In this sense, largely displaced {{noncog|ang|ārfæst}}.

